This testdef starts a CMPASO-CFSv2 run on 2011-08-01 (Hurricane Irene)
instead of the start of the CFSv2 forcing record (2011-01-01), which is
the reference used by the compset and grid defaults.

It changes three things:
    RUN_STARTDATE (xml)                       -> 2011-08-01
    STOP_N (xm)                               -> 30
    config_tidal_potential_reference_time     -> '2011-08-01_00:00:00'
